<title>UK: DG Bank prices 500 mln mark June 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>DG Bank prices 500 mln mark June 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, has been priced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DG BANK DEUTSCHE GENOSSENSCHAFTSBANK</p>
<p> AMT   *1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     4.25	MATURITY    05.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0375  PAY DATE    18.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.1875    REOFFER    100.90    SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 1	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.1375    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    *ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN MARK DEAL LAUNCHED 26.NOV.96 AT</p>
<p>99.6475</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
